---
// Style guide section: Components
// Markup ported word for word from the original case-study.html.
import { asset } from '../../lib/site';
---
<section class="section_style-guide-components" data-pane="style-guide" id="sg-components">
      <div class="padding-global padding-section-medium"><div class="container-large">
        <div class="heading_component is-narrow" data-anim=""><span class="text-style-eyebrow text-color-brand">09</span><h2 class="heading-style-h3">Components</h2><p class="text-color-secondary">The pieces that make the page work, shown in their real states.</p></div>
        <div class="style-guide_components" data-anim-group="">
          <div class="style-guide_component"><p class="style-guide_label">Navbar · navbar_component › navbar_container</p><div class="navbar_container is-static"><a class="brand_link" href="#"><img class="brand_logo" src={asset('logo.webp')} alt="Redline MD, Medical Contract Review" width="560" height="136"></a><a class="button is-small" href="#"><span class="button_content">Upload contract</span><span class="button_hover"></span></a></div></div>
          <div class="style-guide_component"><p class="style-guide_label">Clause redline · demo_clause is-active · demo_strike · demo_insert</p><p class="demo_clause is-active"><span class="demo_clause-number">6.1</span>For <span class="demo_strike">24 months</span> <span class="demo_insert">12 months</span> after termination, Physician shall not practice within <span class="demo_strike">25 miles</span> <span class="demo_insert">10 miles</span> of any Practice location.</p></div>
          <div class="style-guide_component is-dark"><p class="style-guide_label is-light">Flags · demo_flag · demo_flag is-active · demo_flag-dot is-mid</p><div class="demo_flag is-active"><span class="demo_flag-dot"></span>Tail coverage paid by you<span class="demo_flag-level">High</span></div><div class="demo_flag"><span class="demo_flag-dot is-mid"></span>Short notice period<span class="demo_flag-level">Medium</span></div></div>
          <div class="style-guide_component is-dark"><p class="style-guide_label is-light">Calculator row · demo_calc-row · demo_calc-term · demo_calc-sub · tooltip_component</p><div class="demo_calc-row is-result"><span class="demo_calc-label"><span class="demo_calc-term">Tail coverage</span><span class="demo_calc-sub">What you pay when you leave, if the contract says so</span></span><span class="demo_calc-result">$30,000</span></div></div>
          <div class="style-guide_component"><p class="style-guide_label">Cost bars · pricing_row · pricing_bar is-us / is-firm / is-risk</p><div class="pricing_row is-us"><div class="pricing_name">Redline MD</div><div class="pricing_track"><span class="pricing_bar is-us"></span></div><div class="pricing_value">$199</div></div><div class="pricing_row is-risk"><div class="pricing_name">Tail</div><div class="pricing_track"><span class="pricing_bar is-risk"></span></div><div class="pricing_value is-risk">$10,000+</div></div></div>
          <div class="style-guide_component"><p class="style-guide_label">Carousel nav · carousel_dot is-active · carousel_arrow</p><div class="carousel_nav is-shown"><div class="carousel_dots"><span class="carousel_dot is-active"></span><span class="carousel_dot"></span><span class="carousel_dot"></span></div><div class="carousel_arrows"><div class="carousel_arrow is-off" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Previous">←</div><div class="carousel_arrow" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Next">→</div></div></div></div>
          <div class="style-guide_component"><p class="style-guide_label">Upload step · modal_progress · modal_dropzone · modal_foot</p><div class="modal_progress"><span class="modal_progress-bar is-active"></span><span class="modal_progress-bar"></span><span class="modal_progress-bar"></span></div><p class="modal_step">Step 1 of 3</p><div class="modal_dropzone"><span class="modal_dropzone-title">Drop your file or tap to choose</span><span class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">PDF or Word, up to 30 pages</span></div></div>
          <div class="style-guide_component"><p class="style-guide_label">Cookie card · cookie_banner · cookie_actions</p><div class="cookie_banner is-static"><p class="cookie_title">Cookies</p><p class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">We use cookies to measure traffic and improve your experience.</p><div class="cookie_actions"><a class="button is-small is-secondary" href="#"><span class="button_content">Reject</span></a><a class="button is-small" href="#"><span class="button_content">Accept</span></a></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="style-guide_subheading" data-anim=""><p class="heading-style-h4">Webflow components</p></div>
        <div class="style-guide_components" data-anim-group="">
          <div class="style-guide_component"><p class="style-guide_label">Global Styles · every page · code embed</p><p class="text-color-secondary">The states that JavaScript and Finsweet switch on, and the button hover. The only CSS outside the classes.</p></div>
          <div class="style-guide_component"><p class="style-guide_label">Project Bar · every page · project-bar_component</p><p class="text-color-secondary">Links the landing page, the case study and this style guide.</p></div>
          <div class="style-guide_component"><p class="style-guide_label">Navbar · landing page · navbar_component</p><p class="text-color-secondary">Logo, section links and the upload button, fixed at the top.</p></div>
          <div class="style-guide_component"><p class="style-guide_label">Footer · landing page · footer_component</p><p class="text-color-secondary">Logo, product and legal links, contact and the disclaimer.</p></div>
          <div class="style-guide_component"><p class="style-guide_label">Overlays · landing page · overlays_component</p><p class="text-color-secondary">Upload flow, sample report, legal modals, cookie banner and the sticky CTA on mobile.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div></div>
    </section>
